    <string name="privacy_body">Nexus stores your country, places and the people you save only on this phone. That data is not uploaded and is excluded from Android backup.\n\nPlace suggestions send the text you type to a map search service. To fill a cab app\'s destination, the saved address is turned into coordinates by this phone\'s own location service.\n\nContacts are read only after you agree, and only to find a name you asked for. Nexus does not read other apps\' screens and cannot see cab fares.</string>
